description:
Add GNSS-synchronized hopping functions to lichen-core.

## File
rust/lichen-core/src/sync_hop.rs (new file)

## Functions

### synchronized_hop_channel
```rust
/// Calculate hop channel from SFN using LICHEN hash.
///
/// Returns channel in range [1, n_channels].
pub fn synchronized_hop_channel(sfn: u32, seed: u32, n_channels: u8) -> u8 {
    let mut data = [0u8; 8];
    data[0..4].copy_from_slice(&seed.to_le_bytes());
    data[4..8].copy_from_slice(&sfn.to_le_bytes());
    let h = lichen_hash_32(&data);
    1 + (h % n_channels.max(3) as u32) as u8
}
```

### sfn_from_unix_ms
```rust
/// Derive SFN from unix timestamp.
pub fn sfn_from_unix_ms(unix_ms: u64, superframe_ms: u32, epoch_base_ms: u64) -> u32 {
    ((unix_ms.saturating_sub(epoch_base_ms)) / superframe_ms as u64) as u32
}
```

